    fixup! vfs: change ->create/->mkdir operations unavailable errno

    The check lives in the two helpers now. Drop the comment changes to
    the uapi errno.h headers. They don't change what userspace sees, the
    strerror() text comes from libc, and they would need the alpha, mips,
    parisc and sparc maintainers.

    Signed-off-by: Christian Brauner (Amutable) <brauner@kernel.org>

